# Eaten by Piranhas first, on Bot2's Llanowar Elves (flashed in on Bot2's turn), Ygra later. In timestamp order (neither
# changes what the other applies to, CR 613.7): layer 4, Piranhas' makes the Elves a Skeleton creature only, then Ygra's
# adds artifact and Food; layer 6, Piranhas' takes every ability, then Ygra's grants "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this permanent:
# You gain 3 life" after it, which stays (CR 613.1f). Bot2 activates it: 3 life, and the Elves go to the graveyard as a Food,
# so Ygra gets two counters. The other order is ygra-then-eaten-by-piranhas-leaves-a-creature-only-a-skeleton-without-the-food-ability.

